---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Brass bands · what bndy is building"
  description="How bndy is building a trustworthy, evidence-led map of brass bands, concerts and festivals without mixing it into the existing grassroots live edition."
  path="/brassbands"
>
  <section class="brass-hero">
    <div class="brass-kicker">A new bndy edition</div>
    <h1>Brass bands deserve a living map too.</h1>
    <p class="brass-lead">We’re building <strong>brass.bndy.live</strong>: bands, concerts, festivals and the relationships between them, assembled from public evidence and projected into bndy only when we’re confident enough to stand behind it.</p>
    <div class="brass-badges">
      <span>Evidence first</span><span>Human-claimable</span><span>Source-aware</span><span>Edition isolated</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brass-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE IDEA</span>
      <h2>Not another scraped events list.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-copy">A brass band changes name. A sponsor changes. A conductor appears for one concert. A website gets updated. A contest result records an old identity. A venue lists a date differently to the band.</p>
    <p class="section-copy"><strong>Those are not just rows. They are claims about real things.</strong></p>
  </section>

  <section class="flow" aria-label="bndy brass intelligence flow">
    <div class="flow-card source">
      <span class="step">01</span>
      <h3>Sources</h3>
      <p>Official band sites, contest listings, Brass Band Results, 4barsrest, venue pages, ticket pages and regional directories.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <span class="step">02</span>
      <h3>Observations</h3>
      <p>What did this source actually say, when did we see it, and where did it come from?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
    <div class="flow-card">
      <span class="step">03</span>
      <h3>Claims</h3>
      <p>“This is the current band name.” “This was a former name.” “This concert is at this venue on this date.”</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
    <div class="flow-card accent">
      <span class="step">04</span>
      <h3>Verification + inference</h3>
      <p>Independent evidence reinforces or conflicts with a claim. Confidence rises, falls, or goes to review.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow down">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-card wide">
      <span class="step">05</span>
      <h3>Projection</h3>
      <p>Only when the evidence is strong enough do we project a clean canonical Band, Concert, Festival or Venue into bndy. Ambiguous identities stay out until they are resolved.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
    <div class="flow-card canonical">
      <span class="step">06</span>
      <h3>Canonical bndy record</h3>
      <p>One persistent identity, linked to the evidence that made us believe it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brass-section split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">WHY CLAIMS MATTER</span>
      <h2>A band is not just its current name.</h2>
      <p>Sponsored and historical names can all describe the same organisation. bndy keeps one identity and attaches name history to it instead of creating duplicates.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="identity-card">
      <div class="identity-title">Canonical identity</div>
      <strong>KNDS Fairey Band</strong>
      <div class="identity-line"><span>current official</span> KNDS Fairey Band</div>
      <div class="identity-line"><span>former / common</span> Fairey Band</div>
      <div class="identity-line"><span>former sponsor</span> Williams Fairey Engineering Band</div>
      <div class="identity-note">Different names. Same band.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brass-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">TRUST MODEL</span>
      <h2>Inference helps. It never outranks ownership.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-grid">
      <div><b>Inferred</b><p>Evidence suggests something is true.</p></div>
      <div><b>Official source</b><p>The band, venue or organiser publishes it directly.</p></div>
      <div><b>Claimed</b><p>The real organisation takes ownership of its bndy profile.</p></div>
      <div><b>Verified</b><p>Identity has been confirmed against trusted contact evidence.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="trust-rule">New evidence can challenge old evidence. It cannot silently overwrite a claimed, verified fact.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="brass-section isolation">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">ONE PLATFORM · MULTIPLE EDITIONS</span>
      <h2>Brass does not contaminate bndy.live.</h2>
      <p>We use the same canonical platform, but publication is explicit. A brass-only Band, Concert or Venue is invisible to the existing grassroots live edition unless we deliberately choose to share it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="scope-demo">
      <div class="scope-row"><code>["live"]</code><span>→</span><b>bndy.live</b></div>
      <div class="scope-row brass"><code>["brass"]</code><span>→</span><b>brass.bndy.live</b></div>
      <div class="scope-row"><code>["live","brass"]</code><span>→</span><b>both, deliberately</b></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="map-preview">
    <div class="map-grid"></div>
    <div class="map-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">WHERE IT ENDS UP</span>
      <h2>A map you can actually use.</h2>
      <p><strong>Concerts</strong> shows what’s happening, using the same practical date and favourites ideas as bndy.live.</p>
      <p><strong>Bands</strong> switches the map to the home locations of brass bands across the country.</p>
      <div class="toggle-demo"><span class="active">Concerts</span><span>Bands</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pins" aria-hidden="true">
      <i style="left:18%;top:28%"></i><i style="left:29%;top:59%"></i><i style="left:43%;top:37%"></i><i style="left:55%;top:65%"></i><i style="left:67%;top:31%"></i><i style="left:77%;top:54%"></i><i style="left:84%;top:22%"></i>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="brass-close">
    <span class="eyebrow">BUILDING IN PUBLIC</span>
    <h2>Find the evidence. Understand the relationship. Publish what we can defend.</h2>
    <p>That is the intelligence layer behind the map.</p>
    <a class="brass-cta" href="https://brass.bndy.live">brass.bndy.live →</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .brass-hero,.brass-section,.map-preview,.brass-close,.flow{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}
  .brass-hero{padding:110px 0 70px;max-width:1040px;text-align:center}
  .brass-kicker,.eyebrow,.step{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent,#7c3aed)}
  .brass-hero h1{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6.8rem);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:18px 0 30px}
  .brass-lead{font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.45rem);line-height:1.55;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}
  .brass-badges{display:flex;gap:9px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.brass-badges span{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 18%,transparent);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem}
  .brass-section{padding:78px 0;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 13%,transparent)}
  .section-heading{max-width:800px}.brass-section h2,.map-preview h2,.brass-close h2{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,4.2rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0 24px}.section-copy{max-width:850px;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}
  .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1.2fr;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;padding:30px 0 90px}.flow-card{padding:24px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 15%,transparent);border-radius:18px;background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 4%,transparent)}.flow-card h3{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:1.45rem;margin:15px 0 10px}.flow-card p{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf);margin:0}.flow-card.accent{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#7c3aed) 65%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#7c3aed) 10%,transparent)}.flow-card.wide{grid-column:2/5}.flow-card.canonical{grid-column:6/8}.flow-arrow{align-self:center;font-size:1.5rem;opacity:.4}.flow-arrow.down{grid-column:1/8;text-align:center}
  .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.split p{font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}.identity-card{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 15%,transparent);border-radius:20px;padding:28px;background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 4%,transparent)}.identity-title{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55;margin-bottom:8px}.identity-card>strong{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:2rem}.identity-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px 1fr;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);padding:13px 0;margin-top:14px}.identity-line span{font-size:.73rem;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--accent,#7c3aed)}.identity-note{margin-top:15px;font-weight:700}
  .trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:34px}.trust-grid>div{padding:22px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 13%,transparent)}.trust-grid b{font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem}.trust-grid p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}.trust-rule{margin-top:22px;font-weight:700}
  .isolation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.isolation p{line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}.scope-demo{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 13%,transparent);border-radius:18px;padding:18px}.scope-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent)}.scope-row:last-child{border:0}.scope-row code{font-size:.8rem}.scope-row.brass{color:var(--accent,#7c3aed)}
  .map-preview{position:relative;min-height:520px;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:70px;margin-bottom:90px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 15%,transparent);background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 3%,transparent)}.map-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 7%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 7%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:48px 48px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 0%,#000 65%,transparent 92%)}.map-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;width:min(540px,90%);padding:70px 0 70px 7%}.map-copy p{line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#a7afbf)}.toggle-demo{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 15%,transparent);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;margin-top:15px}.toggle-demo span{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700}.toggle-demo .active{background:var(--accent,#7c3aed);color:white}.pins{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}.pins i{position:absolute;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50% 50% 50% 0;background:var(--accent,#7c3aed);transform:rotate(-45deg);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#7c3aed) 14%,transparent)}
  .brass-close{text-align:center;padding:90px 0 120px}.brass-close h2{max-width:950px;margin:14px auto 25px}.brass-close p{color:var(--muted,#a7afbf);font-size:1.1rem}.brass-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent,#7c3aed);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}
  @media(max-width:900px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flow-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);text-align:center}.flow-arrow.down{grid-column:auto;transform:none}.flow-card.wide,.flow-card.canonical{grid-column:auto}.split,.isolation{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.map-preview{min-height:560px}.map-grid{opacity:.35}.pins{opacity:.55}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.brass-hero{padding-top:75px}.brass-section{padding:56px 0}.trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.identity-line{grid-template-columns:1fr}.map-copy{padding:48px 24px;width:auto}.scope-row{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.scope-row b{grid-column:1/3}.brass-close{padding:70px 0 90px}}
</style>
